// Concurrent dictation sessions, estimated (DIAAT-284; events from OBS-4), per 5 minutes.
//
// Run against the environment's Application Insights resource (customEvents). No
// parameters: the time range comes from the caller.
//
// There is no server-side session count and no heartbeat event (the 30 s heartbeat in
// lib/dictation-session.ts is browser localStorage only, used to recover the end of a
// killed page). Concurrency is therefore derived from each session's journey
// (hmcts.journey.type "dictation.session", hmcts.journey.id):
//   start = first event of the journey received (normally "dictation.session_requested");
//   end   = start + hmcts.duration_ms of "dictation.session_ended" (the browser-measured
//           session length; a stored end sent later by another page keeps its real
//           length), or the journey's last event if no end arrived; capped at 12 hours.
// Formula: active_sessions = sessions whose [start, end] overlaps the 5-minute slot.
// Caveats: an estimate. Sessions that started before the time range are not counted;
// a session whose end was lost is cut at its last event (silent recording sends few
// events), so the count is a lower bound. Includes paused sessions (the page is open).
customEvents
| extend area = coalesce(tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.area"]),
    tostring(split(tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.journey.type"]), ".")[0]))
| where area == "dictation"
| where tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.journey.type"]) == "dictation.session"
| extend journey_id = tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.journey.id"]),
    ended_ms = iff(name == "dictation.session_ended", todouble(customDimensions["hmcts.duration_ms"]), real(null))
| summarize start = min(timestamp), last_seen = max(timestamp), ended_ms = max(ended_ms) by journey_id
| extend finish = iff(isnotnull(ended_ms), start + ended_ms * 1ms, last_seen)
| extend finish = min_of(max_of(finish, start), start + 12h)
| mv-expand slot = range(bin(start, 5m), finish, 5m) to typeof(datetime) limit 200
| summarize active_sessions = count() by timestamp = slot
| order by timestamp asc
